digraph account_payable_process_131 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the vendor accounting department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the vendor accounting department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"gather the receiving report" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "gather the receiving report"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"gather the receiving report" -> "schedule the payment"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the vendor accounting department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"schedule the payment" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the vendor accounting department. 
Once sending to the vendor accounting department occurs, creating a receiving report should be done. 
When creating a receiving report is completed, gathering the receiving report needs to be done. 
Once gathering the receiving report occurs, scheduling the payment should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It starts with the submission to the vendor accounting department.
Once the receipt occurs to the vendor Accounting department, the creation of a receiving report should be done.
When a receiving report is completed, the receiving report should be completed.
Once gathering the receiving report occurs, the payment should be made.
The process is now complete.
"
